    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sheehy Meares Real Estate are delighted to present Kylemore, Railway View, a detached residence positioned in one of Athlone?s most central and established residential locations, offering a superb opportunity to acquire a property on a generous site.\n\nThis property offers spacious and well-proportioned accommodation, presenting an excellent opportunity for purchasers seeking a family home in a mature and highly convenient residential location close to Athlone Town Centre.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, kitchen, living room, bathroom and two ground floor bedrooms, with two further bedrooms at first floor level. The flexible four bedroom layout provides generous living accommodation with plenty of potential for a new owner to modernise and create a comfortable family home to suit their own style and requirements.\n\nTo the rear, the property benefits from an enclosed private yard, providing useful outdoor space together with potential to further enhance the property, subject to any necessary planning permission.\n\nTo the front, there is the added convenience of off street parking with traditional boundary wall access.\n\nRailway View is a well - established and sought - after residential area, ideally positioned just minutes from Athlone Town Centre. A wide range of schools, shops, cafes, restaurants, public transport links and everyday amenities are all within easy reach, making this a particularly convenient location for family living.\n\nWith its spacious accommodation, four - bedroom layout and excellent town location , this property offers a wonderful opportunity to create a comfortable and welcoming family home in the heart of Athlone.\n\n\nSolicitor: \nTony Henry Tormey Solicitors LLP , Castle Street, Athlone Co Westmeath \nN37 D960 \n090 6493456 \ninfo@tormeys.ie"
      },
